{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "cortico-world-diary-alont1",
  "version": "0.1.5",
  "describe": {
    "tools": [
      {
        "name": "diary_snap",
        "description": "截一张现在的屏幕，存进今天的日记；可以附一句今天的话。",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "note": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "今天的一句话，可选。"
            }
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "write"
        ],
        "summary": {
          "zh": "截屏存进今天的日记。",
          "en": "Saves a screenshot into today's diary."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "diary_today",
        "description": "看今天日记里有没有图，以及当时写的话。",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {}
        },
        "tags": [
          "read"
        ],
        "summary": {
          "zh": "看今天的日记。",
          "en": "Reads today's diary."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "diary_list",
        "description": "最近几天的日记（按天）。",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "days": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "看最近几天，默认 7，最多 30。"
            }
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "read"
        ],
        "summary": {
          "zh": "最近几天的日记。",
          "en": "Lists recent diary days."
        }
      }
    ],
    "events": []
  },
  "changelog": {
    "0.1.5": "- 快照串行执行配额检查，按最大编号递增；删除中间图片后不覆盖已有照片。\n- 系统未生成非空图片时明确失败，不再仅凭子进程退出判定成功。\n- 面板保留快速交替启停的最终停止，显示执行中调用与耗时，按 failed:true 统计失败；面板代码随包内置。\n- 按 Cortico 0.2.7 的 World API 6 / Bot API 7 检查适用契约；单包产物不引入其他扩展。"
  }
}
